<title>GERMANY: Porsche to sell stake in Sonauto.</title>
<headline>Porsche to sell stake in Sonauto.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>German car maker Dr.Ing.h.c.F. Porsche AG said on Friday it would give up its 31 percent stake in France's Sonauto S.A., and increase its 40 percent stake in Porsche Espana S.A. to 100 percent.  </p>
<p>Porsche said it had also raised from 96 percent to 100 percent its stake in Porsche Enterprises, Inc., the holding company for its operations in the United States.</p>
<p>This transaction still requires approval by the U.S. Federal Trade Commission.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, (49-228) 260 97 150</p>
